      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-03-01_WidnesExaminer_art0041" n="art0041">
        <head>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN UNION. - Results of Saturday's Matches.</p>
        <p>NORTHERN RUGBY LEAGUE.</p>
        <p>-.--- G.T.P. G. T. P. Leeds 2 3 13 Halifax Hunslet York • 44 20 Huddersfield 3 210 Dewsbury 1 929 Bromley 0 0 0 Hull Bradford Nethern 2 210 Keighley Swinton Salford 1 0 9 Warrington Oldham 2 3 13 Leigh '`) 1 7 St Helens Rocladaie Hornets 0 2 6 Runcorn Broughton Rang... 6 733 Coventry NORTHERN RUGBY COMBINATION. Widnes A Dewsbury A 17 Batley A Beverley Warrington A —— 16 Salford A Leeds A 3 4 18 Halifax A 0 0 0 Oldnam A 8 Leigh A Huddert•field A 0 1 3 Rochdale H'ts A 0 0 0 Wigan A — 44 Leigh Shamrocks 0 0 0</p>
