        <p>RYLANDS. WHITECROSS. Handicap 32 Handicap BO W Langley (capt) J Leah lOO A Siddall 3 Jeffery 99 S James lOO J Armitage lOO T Corless G Thomas H Eyes E Blackledge lOO W White J Sinclair</p>
        <p>Total 747 Total ... 701 Rylands' on by 46 points. FRIENDLY MATCHES. JUNIOR LIBF.RAL CLUB V UNITED IRISH LEAGUE. —At the Junior Liberal Club. Scores : 11. I. LEAGUE. JUNIOR LIBERALS. ' T Corless D Shepherd F Tivnan 75 A Percival M Cain 72 W Hughes 75 J Conheeney 65 W E Knight C Kelly J B Kelly E Reilly 7l E A Wallington</p>
