        <p>IN MEIVORIAII. In loving memory of SARAH ELIZIDETH WOOD, who died February 27th, 1912, One year has passed since that sad day When one we loved was called away, A loving mother kind and true, Our loving hearts remember you. From Husband and Children.</p>
